//! Baked single-precision DCT-III coefficient matrices `C[k][x]` for the
//! XUASTC weight-grid inverse DCT, one per 1D size N in 2..=12 (`IDCT_COEFFS_N`,
//! gathered in `IDCT_COEFFS`). The literals carry per-cell f32 rounding noise,
//! so they are not recomputable from a fresh derivation; structurally-zero
//! terms are stored as 0.0, exact under f32 accumulation.

// The literals are written at full f32 printed precision, which the
// excessive_precision lint would otherwise flag even though they round-trip to
// the same bits.
#![allow(clippy::excessive_precision)]

